# CNG signer / X509 — scoped closeout

Implemented client/package X509 preparation/verification and CNG ports bound to the existing portable core and native key owner. All functional writes used exact reviewed operations; preimages and hashes are preserved. No backend is installed in the runtime.

The requested integration remains partial: SERVER lacks factual ExpectedServerName binding; the full caller/CA/stack/retention budget and native administrative/key authority are unqualified. No native private operation or real certificate was produced.

See [proof and qualification handoff](implementation-proof-and-handoff.md), [ED11](ed11-census.json), final-test-results.json, verification.json and final-manifest.json.

